{"id":71084,"date":"2026-10-28T07:14:34","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T07:14:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71084"},"modified":"2026-10-28T08:16:11","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T07:16:11","slug":"trilhos-das-azenhas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-das-azenhas\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilhos das Azenhas 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilhos das Azenhas 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trilhos das Azenhas 2027<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>3 e 4 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, tendo como centro nevr\u00e1lgico o <strong>Centro Cultural e Recreativo do Dianteiro<\/strong> (Largo 25 de Abril, Dianteiro), no concelho e distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. O evento leva-te a percorrer trilhos naturais, ribeiras de azenhas tradicionais e caminhos rurais que ligam v\u00e1rias aldeias hist\u00f3ricas da periferia norte de Coimbra.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A programa\u00e7\u00e3o arranca no s\u00e1bado, 3 de abril, \u00e0s 16:00 com os escal\u00f5es jovens do <strong>Trail Kids (400 m a 2.000 m)<\/strong>, seguindo-se no domingo, 4 de abril, o <strong>Trilhos das Azenhas Sprint (19 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:00, o <strong>Trilhos das Azenhas Mini (14 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:30 \u2014 prova integrante do <strong>Circuito Distrital de Mini Trail de Coimbra (ADAC)<\/strong> \u2014 e a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 10:00.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Clube de Praticantes Roda Dianteira BTT<\/strong>, o evento inclui cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos (aos km 7, 15 e meta), seguro desportivo, registo fotogr\u00e1fico, pr\u00e9mio finisher ou brinde alusivo e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio final para todos os inscritos. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-